body:
IMPLEMENTATION SPIKE + SPEC REVISION — no shared repository files changed.

The four accepted profile refinements are incorporated in the off-tree specification. Current draft: 804 lines, 6,169 words, SHA-256 b43c60a0c97ac13e2424715330392599230ef040e1eca0f040177548a463e591.

The typed prototype is built from storymodel4s exact base c8ffe86 in /tmp and now includes:
- mandatory profile disposition receipts carrying schema/policy, verifier, execution, prerequisites, exact preview/assets, and enumerated court outcomes;
- satisfied network-independent implies matching satisfied local-open with receipt lineage;
- closed failure codes plus evidence receipt ids, with no raw exception/log field;
- validating non-case roots and external-package Mirror/copy probes;
- strict source identities, Established/Unestablished accounting, independent semantic/report/projection outcomes, canonical result/manifest codecs, and external BundleId.

Scoped evidence: acquire 92, view 53, codec 112 passed independently on JVM, Scala.js, and Native. scalafmtCheckAll and compileAll passed. Fresh sibling compilation caught and repaired one warm-cache false green in the acquisition decoder. Mutations killed: removing required-asset binding makes the exact checksum court fail; changing BundleManifest to a case class makes the clean-recompiled external Mirror court fail.

StoryAtlas exact base 003f12b was separately archived in /tmp and instantiated the contract as a deterministic seven-file bundle and bundle CLI: source.txt, canonical.txt, storymodel.json, result.json, preview.txt, preview.html, manifest.json. It renders a text rail, Atlas and Codex projections, and separate discourse/world-time/causal inventories from the same admitted model. CLI suite: 19 passed. Mutating back to all-or-nothing HTML composition kills the forced-lowering partial-delivery court.

Local-open remains honestly NotAttempted by default until a controlled browser receipt exists. The required pre/post ownership audits were clean, but the installed browser plugin imports a removed older runtime version, so no browser process started and no file-open certification was manufactured.

Still needed before repository candidates: chief child beads/exact paths and the ADR line for codec depending on view; then install the reviewed spec and split implementation into the assigned storymodel4s and storyatlas4s paths.
